WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,980
Entering Tianqiong Base tomorrow

2
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:15,740
The foundation genes are still not enough to see where the C-class will be.

3
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:19,260
Remember to register the private mecha or not.

4
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,740
It's illegal for you to use a mecha in an urban area

5
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,100
Last time we were in the arena it was a state of emergency

6
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:27,100
No registration next time

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,140
Well, I've already broken the law twice before.

8
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,150
So let you make up for it

9
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:37,570
It's not like I'm asking you to surrender. It's almost time.

10
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:48,960
It should be about the same size as the research institute I had in my previous life. I'll go to Director Fang.

11
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:51,530
Why are you in a wheelchair after not seeing me for a day?

12
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:52,940
The base is too big

13
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:53,900
Too lazy to walk

14
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:57,920
Sitting in a wheelchair saves effort. You can’t even try it. You sit, you sit.

15
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,200
You are now a celebrity in the Ministry of Military Industry

16
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:02,680
These little guys watched the live broadcast of the game yesterday

17
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:05,480
I made a welcome sign for you overnight

18
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,160
Brother Chu

19
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:11,790
That one shot has too many design drawings

20
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:13,550
Can you show me the name of the sky?

21
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:15,750
I will also build a double-type Tai mecha in the future.

22
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:22,420
Come one by one

23
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:50,660
This is the real poor base. Qi Ming leads the way, Brother Yao.

24
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:51,900
Are you ready?

25
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:54,380
Our Tianqiong Base is very big.

26
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:56,580
always ready for you

27
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:00,400
Don't look at how big I can be if you leave me alone

28
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:14,150
Tianqiong base is very big
